# vws-global release inputs (vws-deploy#766); console-api also builds vws-aws-proxy.
# The console-api pin is main at vws-console-api#1079 (7d36146), after #1067, #1072, #1074 and #1075: the global
# binary no longer dials PVE for the connection test, only the region daemon does; vws-region takes -region and
# -state-dir, takes the PVE addresses and CA from the registration, and fails over between addresses; the helper
# is gone. vws region remove deregisters the daemon (#1072, #1074), and an endpoint change needs a new token
# (#1075). Node networks that list an SDN vnet decode, and the region daemon logs the cause of an internal
# error (#1079). The console pin is the merge commit of vws-console#217: it sends pveApiUrls, caPem and the write
# secrets that console-api now requires, shows the API node, and has no own S3 hosting (#215).
